  "title": "Ashlands",
  "source_analysis": [
    {
      "finding": "Repo resolves to addable-labs/ashlands: an action-RPG in the spirit of Morrowind, first/third-person exploration, skills-by-use, spellmaking, topic dialogue, hand-authored quest graph, running in browser on Three.js r185 + WebGL2 with everything procedural and zero binary assets.",
